# Superhuman 1045.0.0 (x86_64 macOS build) on the official Linux build of
# Electron 45.2.3, assembled by electron-transplant on this machine. The package
# distributes nothing from Superhuman: makepkg downloads Superhuman's own macOS
# DMG from Superhuman (source=), and the build verifies it against its pinned
# hash, patches it and installs it under /usr.
#
# How long Superhuman keeps old releases downloadable is unknown.

